{"schema_version":2,"unit_id":"tag:06IL:prose-0001","parent_tag":"06IL","chapter":"formal-defos","node_kind":"paragraph","risk_level":"R3","source_commit":"a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14","source_text":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe general notion of minimality introduced in\nDefinition <REF_0001>\ncan sometimes be deduced from the behaviour on tangent spaces.\nLet <MATH_0001> be a formal object of the predeformation category\n<MATH_0002> and let\n<MATH_0003>\nbe the corresponding morphism. Then we can consider the following\nthe condition\n<MATHSEG_0001> is bijective<MATHSEG_0002>\nand the condition\n<MATHSEG_0003> is bijective on <MATHSEG_0004>-orbits.<MATHSEG_0005>\nHere we are using the identification\n<MATH_0004> of\nExample <REF_0002>\nand the action (<REF_0003>) of derivations\non the tangent spaces. If <MATH_0005> is separable, then\n<MATH_0006> and the two conditions are equivalent.\nIt turns out that, in the presence of condition (S2) a versal formal\nobject is minimal if and only if <MATH_0007> satisfies\n(<REF_0004>).\nMoreover, if <MATH_0008> satisfies (<REF_0005>), then\n<MATH_0009> satisfies (S2).\n\n","source_status":"CURRENT","placeholders":{"STRUCT_0001":"\\noindent","REF_0001":"\\ref{definition-minimal-versal}","MATH_0001":"$\\xi$","MATH_0002":"$\\mathcal{F}$","MATH_0003":"$\\underline{\\xi} : \\underline{R}|_{\\mathcal{C}_\\Lambda} \\to \\mathcal{F}$","MATHSEG_0001":"\\begin{equation}\n\\label{equation-bijective}\nd\\underline{\\xi} : \\text{Der}_\\Lambda(R, k) \\to T\\mathcal{F} \n\\text{","MATHSEG_0002":"}\n\\end{equation}","MATHSEG_0003":"\\begin{equation}\n\\label{equation-bijective-orbits}\nd\\underline{\\xi} : \\text{Der}_\\Lambda(R, k) \\to T\\mathcal{F} \n\\text{","MATHSEG_0004":"}\\text{Der}_\\Lambda(k, k)\\text{","MATHSEG_0005":"}\n\\end{equation}","MATH_0004":"$T\\underline{R}|_{\\mathcal{C}_\\Lambda} = \\text{Der}_\\Lambda(R, k)$","REF_0002":"\\ref{example-tangent-space-prorepresentable-functor}","REF_0003":"\\ref{equation-action}","MATH_0005":"$k' \\subset k$","MATH_0006":"$\\text{Der}_\\Lambda(k, k) = 0$","MATH_0007":"$\\underline{\\xi}$","REF_0004":"\\ref{equation-bijective-orbits}","MATH_0008":"$\\underline{\\xi}$","REF_0005":"\\ref{equation-bijective}","MATH_0009":"$\\mathcal{F}$"},"render":{"prefix":"","suffix":""},"math_text_regions":[{"region_id":"math/0001","delimiter_kind":"environment","source":"\\begin{equation}\n\\label{equation-bijective}\nd\\underline{\\xi} : \\text{Der}_\\Lambda(R, k) \\to T\\mathcal{F} \n\\text{ is bijective}\n\\end{equation}","source_hash":"sha256:c2f6af7287476b7c813986f6161cb416cae3124e4b0d9663eca094268d6eec44","source_byte_span":{"start":400,"end":541},"pieces":[{"kind":"locked","placeholder":"MATHSEG_0001"},{"kind":"text","slot_id":"math/0001/text/0001"},{"kind":"locked","placeholder":"MATHSEG_0002"}],"slots":[{"slot_id":"math/0001/text/0001","source":" is bijective","command":"text","policy_entry":"deformations-natural-16","slot_byte_span":{"start":112,"end":125},"boundary_placeholders":["MATHSEG_0001","MATHSEG_0002"],"classification_witness":{"usage":"deformations-source-frames","usage_source":{"before":"} \n","after":"\n\\end{equation}","environments":["equation"]},"source_label":"formal-defos-section-miniversal-objects-existence","policy_hash":"sha256:f8a34b4e5b7d68795e0dc64557b5b4e7dbafccbf0b101ba18991531598581f9b","anchor":{"source_commit":"a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14","file":"formal-defos.tex","owner_tag":"06IL","owner_label":"formal-defos-section-miniversal-objects-existence","kind":"section","ordinal":1,"matches":[{"container_byte_span":{"start":168214,"end":168355},"container_hash":"sha256:c2f6af7287476b7c813986f6161cb416cae3124e4b0d9663eca094268d6eec44","command_byte_span":{"start":168320,"end":168340},"command_hash":"sha256:98994379d4375d52a8c547842e85b7d693d0a21fa31cd359841ac3e11373d666"}]}}}]},{"region_id":"math/0002","delimiter_kind":"environment","source":"\\begin{equation}\n\\label{equation-bijective-orbits}\nd\\underline{\\x